    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A prostaglandin F analog used to treat OCULAR HYPERTENSION in patients with GLAUCOMA." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D000077338" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D000077339>
    a <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_010004> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Leflunomide" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> <https://identifiers.org/inchikey/VHOGYURTWQBHIL-UHFFFAOYSA-N> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An isoxazole derivative that inhibits dihydroorotate dehydrogenase, the fourth enzyme in the pyrimidine biosynthetic pathway. It is used an immunosuppressive agent in the treatment of RHEUMATOID ARTHRITIS and PSORIATIC ARTHRITIS." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D000077339" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D000077340>
