    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A nitrile and triazole derivative that acts as a selective nonsteroidal aromatase inhibitor. It is used in the treatment of ESTROGEN NUCLEAR RECEPTOR-positive breast cancer in postmenopausal women." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D000077384" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D000077385>
