    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An anti-nematodal agent effective against the intestinal nematodes ASCARIS LUMBRICOIDES (roundworm) and ENTEROBIUS VERMICULARIS (pinworm, threadworm).  It produces a neuromuscular block leading to flaccid muscle paralysis in susceptible worms, which are then dislodged from the gut and expelled in feces." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D000077489" .

