    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A metallic element that has the atomic symbol Bi, and atomic number 83. Its principal isotope is Bismuth 209." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D001729" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D001735>
    a <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_010004> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bithionol" ;
