    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An indicator and reagent. It has been used in serum albumin determinations and as a pH indicator." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D001961" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D001962>
    a <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_010004> ;
