    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A mucolytic agent used in the treatment of respiratory disorders associated with viscid or excessive mucus. (From Martindale, The Extra Pharmacopoeia, 30th ed, p744)" ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D001964" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D001966>
