    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bromotrichloromethane" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> <https://identifiers.org/inchikey/XNNQFQFUQLJSQT-UHFFFAOYSA-N> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A potent liver poison. In rats, bromotrichloromethane produces about three times the degree of liver microsomal lipid peroxidation as does carbon tetrachloride." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D001975" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D001977>
