    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> <https://identifiers.org/inchikey/UGTJLJZQQFGTJD-UHFFFAOYSA-N> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A proton ionophore. It is commonly used as an uncoupling agent and inhibitor of photosynthesis because of its effects on mitochondrial and chloroplast membranes." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D002258" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D002259>
