    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The active metabolite of FOLIC ACID. Leucovorin is used principally as an antidote to FOLIC ACID ANTAGONISTS." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D002955" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D002956>
