    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A fibric acid derivative used in the treatment of HYPERLIPOPROTEINEMIA TYPE III and severe HYPERTRIGLYCERIDEMIA. (From Martindale, The Extra Pharmacopoeia, 30th ed, p986)" ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D002994" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D002995>
