    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An antilipemic agent that is the biologically active metabolite of CLOFIBRATE." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D002995" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D002996>
