    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A triphenyl ethylene stilbene derivative which is an estrogen agonist or antagonist depending on the target tissue. Note that ENCLOMIPHENE and ZUCLOMIPHENE are the (E) and (Z) isomers of Clomiphene respectively." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D002996" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D002997>
