    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A synthetic prostaglandin F2alpha analog. The compound has luteolytic effects and is used for the synchronization of estrus in cattle." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D003008" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D003009>
    a <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_010004> ;
