    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An amino acid that inhibits phosphate-activated glutaminase and interferes with glutamine metabolism. It is an antineoplastic antibiotic produced by an unidentified species of Streptomyces from Peruvian soil. (From Merck Index, 11th ed)" ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D003980" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D003981>
    a <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_010004> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Diazoxide" ;
