    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Analog of KANAMYCIN with antitubercular as well as broad-spectrum antimicrobial properties." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D003982" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D003983>
