    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "N-(1-Oxobutyl)-cyclic 3',5'-(hydrogen phosphate)-2'-butanoate guanosine. A derivative of cyclic GMP. It has a higher resistance to extracellular and intracellular phosphodiesterase than cyclic GMP." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D003995" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D003996>
