    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Dicamba" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> <https://identifiers.org/inchikey/IWEDIXLBFLAXBO-UHFFFAOYSA-N> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A chlorinated organic herbicide." ;
