    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A bactericidal and fungicidal antiseptic. It is used as a 0.1% mouthwash for local infections and oral hygiene. (From Martindale, The Extra Pharmacopoeia, 30th ed, p797)" ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D006590" .

