    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Injectable form of VITAMIN B 12 that has been used therapeutically to treat VITAMIN B 12 DEFICIENCY." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D006879" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D006881>
    a <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_010004> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Hydroxyacetylaminofluorene" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> <https://identifiers.org/inchikey/SOKUIEGXJHVFDV-UHFFFAOYSA-N> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A N-hydroxylated derivative of 2-ACETYLAMINOFLUORENE that has demonstrated carcinogenic action." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D006881" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D006886>
