    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A product from the iodination of tyrosine. In the biosynthesis of thyroid hormones (THYROXINE and TRIIODOTHYRONINE), tyrosine is first iodized to monoiodotyrosine." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D007470" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D007472>
