    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An effective non-ionic, water-soluble contrast agent which is used in myelography, arthrography, nephroangiography, arteriography, and other radiographic procedures. Its low systemic toxicity is the combined result of low chemotoxicity and low osmolality." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D007472" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D007479>
    a <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_010004> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Iopamidol" ;
