    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A non-ionic, water-soluble contrast agent which is used in myelography, arthrography, nephroangiography, arteriography, and other radiological procedures." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D007479" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D007480>
    a <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_010004> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Iopanoic Acid" ;
