    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A radiopaque medium used for urography, angiography, venography, and myelography. It is highly viscous and binds to plasma proteins." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D007482" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D007483>
