    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A contrast medium in diagnostic radiology with properties similar to those of diatrizoic acid. It is used primarily as its sodium and meglumine (IOTHALAMATE MEGLUMINE) salts." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D007483" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D007485>
    a <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_010004> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Ioxaglic Acid" ;
