    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A tricyclic antidepressant that has actions and uses similar to those of AMITRIPTYLINE, but has only weak antimuscarinic and sedative effects. (From Martindale, The Extra Pharmacopoeia, 30th ed, p257)" ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D007488" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D007490>
