    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An irreversible inhibitor of monoamine oxidase types A and B that is used as an antidepressive agent. It has also been used as an antitubercular agent, but its use is limited by its toxicity." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D007490" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D007501>
