    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> <https://identifiers.org/inchikey/JXDYKVIHCLTXOP-UHFFFAOYSA-N> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An indole-dione that is obtained by oxidation of indigo blue. It is a MONOAMINE OXIDASE INHIBITOR and high levels have been found in urine of PARKINSONISM patients." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D007510" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D007513>
