    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A colorless, syrupy, strongly acidic liquid that can form detergents with oleic acid." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D007513" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D007520>
