    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Juvenile hormone analog and insect growth regulator used to control insects by disrupting metamorphosis. Has been effective in controlling mosquito larvae." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D008726" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008727>
    a <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_010004> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Methotrexate" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> <https://identifiers.org/inchikey/FBOZXECLQNJBKD-ZDUSSCGKSA-N> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An antineoplastic antimetabolite with immunosuppressant properties. It is an inhibitor of TETRAHYDROFOLATE DEHYDROGENASE and prevents the formation of tetrahydrofolate, necessary for synthesis of thymidylate, an essential component of DNA." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D008727" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008728>
    a <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_010004> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Methotrimeprazine" ;
