    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A hydrocarbon used as an industrial solvent. It has been used as an aerosal propellent, as a refrigerant and as a local anesthetic. (From Martindale, The Extra Pharmacopoeia, 31st ed, p1403)" ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D008737" .

