    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A homolog of ERGONOVINE containing one more CH2 group. (Merck Index, 11th ed)" ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D008755" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008760>
    a <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_010004> ;
