    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A synthetic hormone used for androgen replacement therapy and as an hormonal antineoplastic agent (ANTINEOPLASTIC AGENTS, HORMONAL)." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D008777" .

