    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A nitroimidazole used to treat AMEBIASIS; VAGINITIS; TRICHOMONAS INFECTIONS; GIARDIASIS; ANAEROBIC BACTERIA; and TREPONEMAL INFECTIONS." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D008795" .

