    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An inhibitor of the enzyme STEROID 11-BETA-MONOOXYGENASE. It is used as a test of the feedback hypothalamic-pituitary mechanism in the diagnosis of CUSHING SYNDROME." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D008797" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008798>
