    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Semisynthetic ampicillin-derived acylureido penicillin. It has been proposed for infections with certain anaerobes and may be useful in inner ear, bile, and CNS infections." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D008802" .

