    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A tetracyclic compound with antidepressant effects. It may cause drowsiness and hematological problems. Its mechanism of therapeutic action is not well understood, although it apparently blocks alpha-adrenergic, histamine H1, and some types of serotonin receptors." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D008803" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008825>
