    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Synthetic antimicrobial related to NALIDIXIC ACID and used in URINARY TRACT INFECTIONS." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D010093" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D010094>
    a <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_010004> ;
