    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An essential aromatic amino acid that is a precursor of MELANIN; DOPAMINE; noradrenalin (NOREPINEPHRINE), and THYROXINE." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D010649" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D010653>
    a <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_010004> ;
