    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A butyl-diphenyl-pyrazolidinedione that has anti-inflammatory, antipyretic, and analgesic activities. It has been used in ANKYLOSING SPONDYLITIS; RHEUMATOID ARTHRITIS; and REACTIVE ARTHRITIS." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D010653" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D010656>
