    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A reagent that is highly selective for the modification of arginyl residues. It is used to selectively inhibit various enzymes and acts as an energy transfer inhibitor in photophosphorylation." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D010658" .

