    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A phenyl mercury compound used mainly as a fungicide. Has also been used as a herbicide, slimicide, and bacteriocide." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D010662" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D010664>
