    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A sympathomimetic that acts mainly by causing release of NOREPINEPHRINE but also has direct agonist activity at some adrenergic receptors. It is most commonly used as a nasal vasoconstrictor and an appetite depressant." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D010665" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D010670>
    a <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_010004> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Phenylthiourea" ;
