    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A 20-carbon branched chain fatty acid. In phytanic acid storage disease (REFSUM DISEASE) this lipid may comprise as much as 30% of the total fatty acids of the plasma. This is due to a phytanic acid alpha-hydroxylase deficiency." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D010831" .

