    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An element that is an alkali metal. It has an atomic symbol Rb, atomic number 37, and atomic weight 85.47. It is used as a chemical reagent and in the manufacture of photoelectric cells." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D012413" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D012428>
    a <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_010004> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Ruthenium" ;
