    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An element that is a member of the chalcogen family. It has an atomic symbol S, atomic number 16, and atomic weight [32.059; 32.076]. It is found in the amino acids cysteine and methionine." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D013455" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D013458>
