    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A stable, physiologically active compound formed in vivo from the prostaglandin endoperoxides. It is important in the platelet-release reaction (release of ADP and serotonin)." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D013929" .

