    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A thymus-dependent nonapeptide found in normal blood. Stimulates the formation of E rosettes and is believed to be involved in T-cell differentiation." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D013935" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D013936>
