    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A phenylethylamine derivative that acts as a calcium antagonist showing hemodynamic effects in patients with acute myocardial infarction." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D013976" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D013982>
