    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A pteridinetriamine compound that inhibits SODIUM reabsorption through SODIUM CHANNELS in renal EPITHELIAL CELLS." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D014223" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D014228>
