    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An organochlorophosphate cholinesterase inhibitor that is used as an insecticide for the control of flies and roaches. It is also used in anthelmintic compositions for animals. (From Merck, 11th ed)" ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D014236" .

