    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A semi-synthetic macrolide antibiotic structurally related to ERYTHROMYCIN. It has been used in the treatment of Mycobacterium avium intracellulare infections, toxoplasmosis, and cryptosporidiosis." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D017963" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D017964>
