    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A stable adenosine A1 and A2 receptor agonist. Experimentally, it inhibits cAMP and cGMP phosphodiesterase activity." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D019830" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D019832>
    a <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_010004> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "N-Methylscopolamine" ;
