    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Benzyl Alcohol" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> <https://identifiers.org/inchikey/WVDDGKGOMKODPV-UHFFFAOYSA-N> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A colorless liquid with a sharp burning taste and slight odor. It is used as a local anesthetic and to reduce pain associated with LIDOCAINE injection. Also, it is used in the manufacture of other benzyl compounds, as a pharmaceutic aid, and in perfumery and flavoring." ;
    <https://schema.org/identifier> "D019905" .

<https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D019946>
